    "description": "<h2>Type</h2><p>Client support request — reported bug.</p><h2>Report</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Reported by:</strong> Emily (WagerTech), 2026-09-22 4:10 PM ET, in the shared Slack channel.</p></li><li><p><strong>Issue:</strong> Error message when creating a new Referrer record. Emily says she gives the input the error asks for, but the error still shows.</p></li><li><p><strong>Screenshot:</strong> In the Slack thread (error text not yet copied into this ticket).</p></li><li><p><strong>Slack (client):</strong> https://jumpr-solutions.slack.com/archives/C0BBC05C2HG/p1790107829456039</p></li></ul><h2>Steps to reproduce (from Emily)</h2><ol><li><p>Log a new signup.</p></li><li><p>In the <strong>Referrer Name</strong> field, click <strong>+ Add New</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Fill in the new Referrer and save.</p></li><li><p>Error shows.</p></li></ol><h2>Expected</h2><p>New Referrer record saves and links to the signup.</p><h2>Unknown</h2><ul><li><p>Exact error text and which field it names.</p></li><li><p>Which org (sandbox or production).</p></li><li><p>Root cause (validation rule, required field, flow, or permission).</p></li></ul><h2>Next steps</h2><ul data-local-id=\"71f7cdb0-9dac-4062-bd57-3378e80e1faa\" data-type=\"task-list\"><li data-local-id=\"2a3d28b7-4008-4bed-b08b-649950a4bdd9\" data-type=\"task-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Copy the error text from the screenshot into this ticket.</li><li data-local-id=\"e3ef1e62-82d2-4ad9-ab6b-915e904ff9f6\" data-type=\"task-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Reproduce with Emily&#039;s steps.</li><li data-local-id=\"753e9f23-5475-4258-b316-4d8296562fec\" data-type=\"task-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Find the cause and fix.</li><li data-local-id=\"1ca7b80e-c6a2-45e3-95ff-94c3e497d3ea\" data-type=\"task-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Confirm with Emily.</li></ul>",
