          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"547f16f2e0d6\"><strong>Changes made:</strong></p><table data-local-id=\"e1a34f67-0745-4f19-b5d7-f05580fd4ffb\"><tbody><tr><td data-local-id=\"0226bc8f6148\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"b29a711f2231\">Metadata Name</p></td><td data-local-id=\"8079899763c0\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"13f557afa8ee\">Metadata Type</p></td><td data-local-id=\"25268aa995fe\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"14c46c501a3c\">Action</p></td><td data-local-id=\"659317ebb489\" data-background=\"#f2f3f4\" style=\"background-color: #f2f3f4\"><p data-local-id=\"7155263e98ef\">Notes</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"4bae32ccf538\"><p data-local-id=\"51a78ecd89c9\">PersonAccount-Referrer Person Account Layout</p></td><td data-local-id=\"171695a0c404\"><p data-local-id=\"d3fcd8854c6e\">PageLayout</p></td><td data-local-id=\"a37585ec8e53\"><p data-local-id=\"1ca7df95a037\">Update Component</p></td><td data-local-id=\"7d937f15b7a4\"><p data-local-id=\"af7ffb68e933\">Update layout to get as close as the lightning record page</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"bdc3331d7a3b\"><p data-local-id=\"3b7d33c79f30\">Referrer_Account_Page1</p></td><td data-local-id=\"e2b0f4d147c4\"><p data-local-id=\"b869fb0d0ff0\">Flexipage</p></td><td data-local-id=\"22f75f70bd62\"><p data-local-id=\"dd5e3bdb4474\">Update Component</p></td><td data-local-id=\"3b7862bfc6e4\"><p data-local-id=\"8c0eb5bd5337\">Added the Account Name. Remove Notes under Player Cross-Reference per Slack conversation.</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"86cfe78b5d6f\"><p data-local-id=\"18591d8461cb\">WagerTech Sales Rep</p></td><td data-local-id=\"4eacb0756dc4\"><p data-local-id=\"288b550e291f\">Profile</p></td><td data-local-id=\"5aee99981a6c\"><p data-local-id=\"544773d664f8\">Update / Reverted</p></td><td data-local-id=\"6512147de82e\"><p data-local-id=\"25610bfc7236\">This is to capture evidence only. Need to finalize the action here.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-local-id=\"fea6995182d2\"><strong>Testing:</strong> Validated in sandbox. Working as Expected. </p><figure data-local-id=\"1464e9eb1721\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"551\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"483f37c2-b418-49e7-90d2-b4ac0a891164\" data-alt=\"Screen Recording 2026-09-24 at 11.56.24 PM.mov\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"782\"></div></figure><figure data-local-id=\"146ac10034fe\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"551\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"987ebf5b-a661-455a-83da-01448546cd5c\" data-alt=\"Screen Recording 2026-09-25 at 12.30.35 AM.mov\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"782\"></div></figure>",
